cad:0_8928485744223281
    a cad:Note;
    rdfs:comment
        """It is possible these would have prevented
the initial access, not enough public information
is available to be 100% certain.

CISA jumped straight to MFA which may have 
been possible to implement quickly. These password
policies on the otherhand are more likely to be supported

by legacy devices.


- Kaloroumakis 9/15/2025""";
    rdfs:label "Missing CISA Countermeasures".
